    "bbox": [
      84.62,
      211.7,
      507.65,
      223.7
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR SEA AREAS AROUND THE ISLAND DURING NEXT 24 HOURS",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      190.25,
      228.53,
      402.14,
      240.53
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 22 September 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      265.73,
      560.27,
      306.65
    ],
    "text": "The depression located over the northwest Bay of Bengal, about 1000 km northeast of the island, is expected to further intensify into a deep depression within the next 12 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      317.45,
      560.36,
      447.67
    ],
    "text": "Due to its influence, wind and rainy condition over the Bay of Bengal will increase. Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the sea areas in between 5\u00b0N and 22\u00b0N latitude and 85\u00b0E and 100\u00b0E longitude until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas. Navel and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea areas are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards. Condition of Rain:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      459.31,
      560.3,
      505.03
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Hambanthota via Puttalam, Colombo and Galle. Showers or thundershowers may occur at several places in the other sea areas during the evening or night.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      516.67,
      96.46,
      528.67
    ],
    "text": "Winds:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      547.78,
      375.86,
      559.78
    ],
    "text": "Winds will be South-westerly. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      562.81,
      558.89,
      597.7
    ],
    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to (50-60) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Trincomalee to Chilaw via Kankasanthurai and Mannar, and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      616.9,
      554.45,
      662.86
    ],
    "text": "State of Sea: The sea areas off the coast extending from Trincomalee to Chilaw via Kankasanthurai and Mannar, and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      665.53,
      554.26,
      699.34
    ],
    "text": "The wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 2.5) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Matara.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      703.27,
      527.21,
      727.44
    ],
    "text": "Temporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  }
